    <div class="faq">
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary class="faq-q">When do balloons fly in Cappadocia? <span class="faq-icon">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">Balloons typically fly around sunrise, between 5:00–7:00 AM; the exact time is confirmed a day in advance depending on wind conditions.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">How do I book? <span class="faq-icon">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">In this first phase, bookings are taken via a WhatsApp request form; our team confirms availability. Online card payment will be added at a later stage.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">What if my flight is cancelled due to weather? <span class="faq-icon">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">If cancelled by the civil aviation authority due to unsafe conditions, you can get a full refund or reschedule to another available date.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

